## Legacy
Vanir was the last alliance of the Valhalla line, and its twenty-day life marks the moment the era's mega-blocs stopped holding together. The winter that followed — [[Khaos]]'s last war against the ex-Vanir guilds — ended in the [[the-realignment-era|2022 realignment]] that produced [[Cucumber Company]], where most Vanir guilds reappeared alongside their former Khaos enemies.{{cite:Chronicle alliance and event records}}
